%% Complete common-path closure and new composite consumers.
%% Generated from the retained H23/P25 source blocks, with exact bindings.
%% Each original assumption and %implied marker is preserved. When two
%% source versions differ, their specification names and dependencies are
%% kept separate rather than silently choosing one theory. See bindings.
%% The source target libraries in sources/targets/ preserve their own
